    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wobbly Construction!",
    "steam_appid": 2761990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord Server!</h1><p>To stay up to date join Wobbly Construction discord server!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/2aeaeeff446a9d2c41c226e4776c8c8b.avif?t=1736436723\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Be warned:</strong> Wobbly Construction is not a fun game - it's a challenge. It's difficult, unforgiving, and the controls are awkward. You'll experience hours of climbing, falling, failed jumps, and frustration. But if you reach the top of the tower, you'll feel an incredible sense of satisfaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awkward third-person controls<br></li><li>Controller and keyboard/mouse support<br></li><li>A variety of annoying obstacles, such as wrecking balls, overturned ladders, and paint cans<br></li><li>Ragdoll physics for hilarious falls and interactions<br></li><li>A 150-meter-tall tower to climb<br></li><li>Multiple character skins to choose from</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch your step!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/3e6e16eb6165f75619f3c112e1524076.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/3e6e16eb6165f75619f3c112e1524076.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The tower is very tall, and every misstep could lead to a big fall, so always watch your step. Be careful of scattered paint cans, brick pallets, overturned ladders, and all the other items carelessly thrown around by the construction workers on your way to the top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't rush!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/76fd69938bd16e65587cbf83f2558d21.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/76fd69938bd16e65587cbf83f2558d21.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This climb will be more of a marathon than a sprint. Don\u2019t be fooled by the seemingly simple obstacles you encounter, as even the easiest ones can turn out to be very punishing, so take your time! It\u2019s better to wait a few seconds than to start the climb all over again. Patience is the key to success.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the very top!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/957c5f3abbb5b820cea371a56fdf3a14.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/957c5f3abbb5b820cea371a56fdf3a14.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This journey will surely take you a long time. Along the way, you'll face much frustration from losing progress due to silly mistakes, but also joy when you finally overcome an obstacle and, ultimately, reach the top. Don\u2019t get upset, don\u2019t give in to emotions, stay calm, and you will surely make it to the summit!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Be warned:</strong> Wobbly Construction is not a fun game - it's a challenge. It's difficult, unforgiving, and the controls are awkward. You'll experience hours of climbing, falling, failed jumps, and frustration. But if you reach the top of the tower, you'll feel an incredible sense of satisfaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awkward third-person controls<br></li><li>Controller and keyboard/mouse support<br></li><li>A variety of annoying obstacles, such as wrecking balls, overturned ladders, and paint cans<br></li><li>Ragdoll physics for hilarious falls and interactions<br></li><li>A 150-meter-tall tower to climb<br></li><li>Multiple character skins to choose from</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch your step!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/3e6e16eb6165f75619f3c112e1524076.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/3e6e16eb6165f75619f3c112e1524076.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The tower is very tall, and every misstep could lead to a big fall, so always watch your step. Be careful of scattered paint cans, brick pallets, overturned ladders, and all the other items carelessly thrown around by the construction workers on your way to the top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't rush!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/76fd69938bd16e65587cbf83f2558d21.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/76fd69938bd16e65587cbf83f2558d21.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This climb will be more of a marathon than a sprint. Don\u2019t be fooled by the seemingly simple obstacles you encounter, as even the easiest ones can turn out to be very punishing, so take your time! It\u2019s better to wait a few seconds than to start the climb all over again. Patience is the key to success.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the very top!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/957c5f3abbb5b820cea371a56fdf3a14.poster.avif?t=1736436723\" width=585 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761990/extras/957c5f3abbb5b820cea371a56fdf3a14.webm?t=1736436723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This journey will surely take you a long time. Along the way, you'll face much frustration from losing progress due to silly mistakes, but also joy when you finally overcome an obstacle and, ultimately, reach the top. Don\u2019t get upset, don\u2019t give in to emotions, stay calm, and you will surely make it to the summit!",
